  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "📦 @goodandready/dsh-lanmode",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<h3>LAN Access, mDNS (dsh.local), PWA, Root CA, Quick QR, Notifications & Auto-TLS for DeepSeek Harness</h3>"
    },
    {
      "section": "📦 @goodandready/dsh-lanmode",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@goodandready/dsh-lanmode\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/@goodandready/dsh-lanmode.svg?style=for-the-badge&color=6366f1&labelColor=1e1b4b\" alt=\"npm version\"></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-10b981.svg?style=for-the-badge&color=10b981&labelColor=064e3b\" alt=\"license\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://goodandready.app/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Author_Portfolio-goodandready.app-ff4500.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=rocket&logoColor=white&labelColor=1a1a2e\" alt=\"Author Projects\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "📦 @goodandready/dsh-lanmode",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"README.md\"><b>🇬🇧 English</b></a> •\n  <a href=\"README.ru.md\"><b>🇷🇺 Русский</b></a> •\n  <a href=\"README.zh.md\"><b>🇨🇳 中文说明</b></a>\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "⚡ Overview & Features",
      "text": "`dsh-lanmode` brings seamless and secure local network (LAN) and WAN remote access to DeepSeek Harness:"
    },
    {
      "section": "⚡ Overview & Features",
      "text": "1. **📱 Quick QR Popover**: Tap the smartphone icon in the sidebar footer (`Quick QR` in `sidebar.footer` / `sidebar.rail`) to open an interactive SVG QR code. Supports the `/mobileqr` chat tool and ASCII QR output.\n2. **📲 PWA & Standalone Mode**: Serves `/dsh-lanmode/manifest.json` with `viewport-fit=cover` for full-screen mobile experience.\n3. **🌐 Automatic mDNS (`dsh.local`)**: Built-in UDP 5353 responder announces `dsh.local` across the LAN automatically.\n4. **🔐 Local Root CA & HTTPS**: Generates a 10-year Root CA and trusted SAN certificates (`dsh.local`, LAN IP, localhost). One-click download via `/dsh-lanmode/ca.crt`.\n5. **🔔 Background Web Push & Notifications API**: Delivers system push notifications on agent turn end and approval requests.\n6. **🛡️ Comprehensive Security & Authentication**:\n   - Authentication passwords support plaintext and scrypt key derivation. Verified in constant time via `timingSafeEqual`.\n   - LAN PIN protection with plaintext or `PBKDF2` stretching (`pbkdf2$sha512$100000$salt$hash`). Auto-lockout for 15 minutes after 5 consecutive failures.\n   - Device and session tokens stored exclusively as salted `SHA-256` digests.\n   - Subnet role separation (`ad"
    },
    {
      "section": "⚡ Overview & Features",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📦 Installation",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add @goodandready/dsh-lanmode\n```\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "⚙️ Configuration (`cordis.patch.yml`)",
      "text": "```yaml\n- id: dsh-lanmode\n  config:\n    mode: direct\n    directPort: 3080\n\n---"
    },
